  "describe": "Bars with the numbers 5 2 8 1 9 3 in a panel, a segmented bar with Step 1 of 16, Pick a list with three segments, a dim Back, Next. Next x1: Pass 1, check 1, 2 5 8 1 9 3 with the pair bracketed and dotted. At 15: all green, Sorted early, stopped after 14 of 15. Almost: ends after 9, step 11 of 11. Reversed: 15, step 17 of 17, Sorted. The last button reads Start over.",
